WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.630
B ra yetame me tɩ ned sã n maan zĩmã wẽnga, a na n sãama a meng ne a zakã rãmba.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:14.568
Woto kɩtame tɩ kom-bɩɩsã zãmsd b kambã tɩ b waoog b ma wã la b zakã neb.

00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:18.519
Rũndã-rũndã me, sãambã kẽeda tãns-kãense.

00:00:18.599 --> 00:00:27.578
La koom-koglgã tẽegda b karen-biisã tɩ b sã n kogend koomã, b waoogda neb nins sẽn deng tõndã.
